  "prompt": "A 10-second psychological detail shot. Start close on the principal subject’s trembling hand. Tilt upward over 2.5 seconds to the eye, then hold for 0.5 seconds. From 3 to 8.5 seconds dolly toward the pupil while zooming optically, ending just outside the eye in an extreme close-up: do not enter the head or fabricate an interior-eye world. Over the final 1.5 seconds roll 10 degrees right and freeze scene time. No cut.",
